  "job_B21.1.1.3_20251003_114533": {
    "chunk_text": "beo\u00f0 cl\u00e6ne & unsare. Wi\u00f0 wambewr\u00e6ce, genim haran helan, ber on \u00feinum hedcla\u00fee. Wundorlice hit h\u00e6le\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 eagena sare, haran lifer gesoden ys god on wine to drincenne, & mid \u00feam bro\u00fee \u00f0a eagan to \u00d0am manum \u00fee fram \u00fe\u00e6re teo\u00fean tide ne geseo\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6s ylcan drinces smyc heora eagan onfon, & mid Wi\u00f0 blodryne, geb\u00e6rned haran lifer & gegniden & on gestreded hra\u00fee hyt gestille\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 blodryne of nebbe, firginbuccan, \u00fe\u00e6t ys wudubucca o\u00f0\u00f0e gat \u00fe\u00e6s lifer gebryted wi\u00f0 ecede & on To eagena beorhtnysse, wudubuccan gealla gemencged wi\u00f0 feldbeona hunige & on gesmyred, seo \u00de\u00e6t ylce m\u00e6g wi\u00f0 gomena sare, gemeng \u00feone geallan & hunig tosomne, hrin \u00fea goman mid, hyt h\u00e6l\u00f0. To eallum uncystum \u00fee on gomum beo\u00f0 acenned, wudugate geallan mid feldbeona hunige gemenged, Seo\u00f0 eall on wine o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t hyt sy wel to sealfe geworht, smyre \u00feonne \u00fea saran goman mid daga Wi\u00f0 eagena dymnesse, wudugate geallan & lytel wines meng tosomne, smyre mid \u00f0riwa. \u00deonne beo\u00f0 hi geh\u00e6lede. Wi\u00f0 dropfagum andwlatan, wudubucan geallan o\u00f0\u00f0e gate gemencged wi\u00f0 w\u00e6tere & on gesmyred. Hra\u00fee hit gelacna\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 nebcorn \u00fee wexa\u00f0 on \u00feam andwlatan, smyre mid gate geallan.",
